<title>USA: CBOT says full membership fetches record $750,000.</title>
<headline>CBOT says full membership fetches record $750,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade said a full membership on the exchange sold Tuesday for a record high $750,000.</p>
<p>The selling price surpasses the previous record of $725,000 set March 4.</p>
<p>The current bid/ask prices for a full CBOT seat, which entitles its holders to trade all CBOT products, are $675,000 and $800,000. ((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
